{"repositoryId":1091812821,"availability":"available","full":"cuihairu/apollo","name":"apollo","description":"Instance-based multiplayer game server engine: baseapp hosts authoritative player state (anchor/save/session), cellapp runs scenes & instances (dungeon, room, match, tower defense, arena), gateway keeps client connections alive across restarts. Co-op/PvE/PvP and instance-oriented MMO; no ghost or seamless-world machinery.","category":"Other","language":"C++","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2025-11-07T14:58:30Z","updated":"2026-10-15T10:59:51Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cuihairu.github.io/apollo/","topics":["cpp20","game-engine","game-server","instance-based","mmo","multiplayer","pve","pvp","tower-defense"],"demo":"https://cuihairu.github.io/apollo/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:30.244Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:30.244Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:30.244Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:20:30.244Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An instance-based multiplayer game server engine.","Instance-based multiplayer game server engine","Apollo is a lightweight, scalable game server runtime for building instance-based multiplayer games, including co-op games, PvE/PvP instances, dungeon systems, tower defense, arena games, and instance-oriented MMO architectures."],"features":["Minimalist constructor-injection DI - apollo::core::di: type-keyed bean graph, topologically ordered assembly, ApplicationHost frame-driven lifecycle","Entity contract system - XML+XSD contracts + standalone generator apollogen; the generator is not in the runtime link graph","Async networking - non-blocking sockets + select()/epoll event loop (Windows polls via select(); no IOCP)","Transport codec (target state) - protobuf reflection as default + zstd (planned); the current implementation uses hand-written encoding","AOI 3×3 grid - SceneAoi sing